WEBVTT

00:05:57.770 --> 00:06:03.526
and I wish that experience for anyone
who has experienced and lives with trauma.

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:07.947
Ethel Blondin-Andrew,
the leader I mentioned before,

00:06:07.988 --> 00:06:11.992
runs training camps for guardians
in the Northwest Territories.

00:06:12.576 --> 00:06:14.662
She says,

00:06:14.703 --> 00:06:18.916
"Residential schools cause great grief
and intergenerational trauma

00:06:18.958 --> 00:06:21.961
because they taught us
that we are not worthy of love."

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:24.505
But we are worthy of love.

00:06:24.547 --> 00:06:26.424
The kids in our camps get it.

00:06:26.757 --> 00:06:31.387
They know that being on the land
is where they are the best human beings